description:
Design a circuit that performs a bitwise AND operation between a 16-bit input, data_in, and a constant mask value (0xABCD) when the enable signal is high. If the enable signal is low, the output data_out will be set to zero. This module essentially acts as a conditional bitwise AND gate, controlling the operation based on the enable signal.
module top_module(
  input [15:0] data_in,
  input enable,
  output reg [15:0] data_out
);

code:
module top_module(
  input [15:0] data_in,
  input enable,
  output reg [15:0] data_out
);parameter MASK_VALUE = 16'hABCD;

  always @(posedge enable) begin
    if (enable) begin
      data_out = data_in & MASK_VALUE;
    end else begin
      data_out = 16'b0;
    end
  end

endmodule

