Design a 2-to-4 decoder with priority functionality. The circuit takes two inputs, A and B, and outputs a 4-bit signal Y. When A is high and B is low, Y outputs "0001". When A is low and B is high, Y outputs "0010". If both A and B are high, Y outputs "0011". If both A and B are low, Y outputs "0000". This design effectively prioritizes the output based on the logical state of the inputs.
